{"id":"n24059-1-7","stage":3,"title":"의논 · 商议","scene":"社会与交往","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n24059-1-7-1","ko":"무슨 일로 나를 찾아왔나?","zh":"有什么事要找我吗？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"무슨","meaning":"什么","explanation":"무슨：什么","readings":[{"term":"무슨","audio":"/audio/41abb599007a8f8a3050.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"66237","senseId":"2","lemma":"무슨","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"일로","meaning":"事情","explanation":"일：事情；로：表示方向、方式、手段、材料、身份或原因等关系。","readings":[{"term":"일","audio":"/audio/dfc76879e2f5c3ead091.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"91895","senseId":"6","lemma":"일","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"나를","meaning":"我","explanation":"나：我；를：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"나","audio":"/audio/1098bbe54520ab2a367c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"60931","senseId":"1","lemma":"나","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"찾아왔나?","meaning":"来找，来访，访问","explanation":"찾아오다：来找，来访，访问；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合。；나：表示疑问或推测内容，常与 보다、싶다 等合用。","readings":[{"term":"찾아오다","audio":"/audio/367f007054a1f285cf95.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"60322","senseId":"1","lemma":"찾아오다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"41abb599007a8f8a","term":"무슨","zh":"什么","audio":"/audio/41abb599007a8f8a3050.mp3","entryId":"66237","definition":"虚指，表示不肯定的事物。","pronunciation":["무슨"]},{"id":"dfc76879e2f5c3ea","term":"일","zh":"事情","audio":"/audio/dfc76879e2f5c3ead091.mp3","entryId":"91895","definition":"所处的情形或状况。","pronunciation":["일ː"]},{"id":"1098bbe54520ab2a","term":"나","zh":"我","audio":"/audio/1098bbe54520ab2a367c.mp3","entryId":"60931","definition":"说话人在朋友或晚辈面前用来指称自己。","pronunciation":["나"]},{"id":"367f007054a1f285","term":"찾아오다","zh":"来找，来访，访问","audio":"/audio/367f007054a1f285cf95.mp3","entryId":"60322","definition":"来见某人或做某事。","pronunciation":["차자오다"]}],"audio":"/audio/466f5d92dbd360ff41df.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n24059-1-7-2","ko":"내일 점심 식사나 같이 하실까요? 의논 드릴 것도 있고 해서요.","zh":"明天一起吃午饭吧？我有事情想跟您商量一下。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"내일","meaning":"明天，明日","explanation":"내일：明天，明日","readings":[{"term":"내일","audio":"/audio/1e07b94ba5182a41e7de.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"30193","senseId":"1","lemma":"내일","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"점심","meaning":"中饭，午饭，午餐","explanation":"점심：中饭，午饭，午餐","readings":[{"term":"점심","audio":"/audio/12cf30d1ce4feda7a77d.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"70868","senseId":"1","lemma":"점심","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"식사나","meaning":"用餐，就餐，餐","explanation":"식사：用餐，就餐，餐；나：表示不止预期的数量、举例或退而求其次等，需结合整句语气。","readings":[{"term":"식사","audio":"/audio/0f82e313dadba4d88a0a.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"29596","senseId":"1","lemma":"식사","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"같이","meaning":"一同，一块儿，共同","explanation":"같이：一同，一块儿，共同","readings":[{"term":"같이","audio":"/audio/d44da011993f2a6e9ba5.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"26799","senseId":"2","lemma":"같이","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"하실까요?","meaning":"做，干","explanation":"하다：做，干；시：主语敬语，尊敬动作或状态的主体。；ㄹ까요：礼貌地询问意见、提出建议或推测：“要不要、会不会”。","readings":[{"term":"하다","audio":"/audio/505de0a2f6be73fa7758.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"73277","senseId":"1","lemma":"하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"의논","meaning":"商议，讨论，商量","explanation":"의논：商议，讨论，商量","readings":[{"term":"의논","audio":"/audio/ec710881e9e65a5d7da6.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"24059","senseId":"1","lemma":"의논","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"드릴","meaning":"致，呈，献，奉上","explanation":"드리다：致，呈，献，奉上；ㄹ：修饰后面的名词，表示预定、意向、推测或可能；具体含义取决于后接表达。","readings":[{"term":"드리다","audio":"/audio/e583f55bf1cfad46331c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"61168","senseId":"1","lemma":"드리다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"것도","meaning":"表示某种行为、状态或事情。","explanation":"것：表示某种行为、状态或事情。；도：表示“也、连……也”。","readings":[{"term":"것","audio":"/audio/1443a6c090b122289ad7.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62835","senseId":"4","lemma":"것","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"있고","meaning":"表示前面所述状态正在持续。","explanation":"있다：表示前面所述状态正在持续。；고：连接并列或先后的动作、状态；也用于 -고 있다 等搭配。","readings":[{"term":"있다","audio":"/audio/96fe52db2531c9e73e53.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62595","senseId":"1","lemma":"있다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"해서요.","meaning":"表示理由或依据。","explanation":"하다：表示理由或依据。；어서요：用礼貌语气补充理由：“因为……”。","readings":[{"term":"하다","audio":"/audio/505de0a2f6be73fa7758.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62888","senseId":"8","lemma":"하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"1e07b94ba5182a41","term":"내일","zh":"明天，明日","audio":"/audio/1e07b94ba5182a41e7de.mp3","entryId":"30193","definition":"今天的下一天。","pronunciation":["내일"]},{"id":"12cf30d1ce4feda7","term":"점심","zh":"中饭，午饭，午餐","audio":"/audio/12cf30d1ce4feda7a77d.mp3","entryId":"70868","definition":"早餐和晚餐之间，白天吃的饭。","pronunciation":["점ː심"]},{"id":"0f82e313dadba4d8","term":"식사","zh":"用餐，就餐，餐","audio":"/audio/0f82e313dadba4d88a0a.mp3","entryId":"29596","definition":"像早餐、午餐、晚餐那样每天在固定时间吃饭；或指那时吃的食物。","pronunciation":["식싸"]},{"id":"d44da011993f2a6e","term":"같이","zh":"一同，一块儿，共同","audio":"/audio/d44da011993f2a6e9ba5.mp3","entryId":"26799","definition":"和某物或某人一起。","pronunciation":["가치"]},{"id":"505de0a2f6be73fa","term":"하다","zh":"做，干；表示理由或依据。","audio":"/audio/505de0a2f6be73fa7758.mp3","entryId":"73277","definition":"进行某种行动、动作或活动。","pronunciation":["하다"]},{"id":"ec710881e9e65a5d","term":"의논","zh":"商议，讨论，商量","audio":"/audio/ec710881e9e65a5d7da6.mp3","entryId":"24059","definition":"对某事互相交换意见。","pronunciation":["의논"]},{"id":"e583f55bf1cfad46","term":"드리다","zh":"致，呈，献，奉上","audio":"/audio/e583f55bf1cfad46331c.mp3","entryId":"61168","definition":"(尊称)给。","pronunciation":["드리다"]},{"id":"1443a6c090b12228","term":"것","zh":"表示某种行为、状态或事情。","audio":"/audio/1443a6c090b122289ad7.mp3","entryId":"62835","definition":"表示某种行为、状态或事情。","pronunciation":["걷"]},{"id":"96fe52db2531c9e7","term":"있다","zh":"表示前面所述状态正在持续。","audio":"/audio/96fe52db2531c9e73e53.mp3","entryId":"62595","definition":"表示前面所述状态正在持续。","pronunciation":["읻따"]}],"audio":"/audio/ce9c955294bd94d7a1b8.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":2.692,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=24059","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"1","sourceLevel":"중급","day":94,"sequenceScore":2.5187,"questions":[{"lineIndex":0,"options":["有什么事要找我吗？","明天一起吃午饭吧？我有事情想跟您商量一下。","我来得太晚了，对吧？对不起。"],"answer":0},{"lineIndex":1,"options":["有什么事要找我吗？","明天一起吃午饭吧？我有事情想跟您商量一下。","我来得太晚了，对吧？对不起。"],"answer":1}]}
